I am in the Späti.
I am looking for a German chocolate for my family.
Here is a bar of chocolate.
I go to the till.
I put my backpack on the counter.
The cashier says, "That is three euros, please."
I pay three euros.
I take the chocolate and go to the door.
Someone calls, "Excuse me!"
Who is calling?
I stop and look back.
The cashier holds up my backpack.
He asks, "Is that your backpack?"
I am surprised.
I say, "Oh, yes!"
"That is my backpack."
I go back and take the backpack.
I say, "Thank you very much!"
He smiles and says, "You are welcome."
I leave the Späti.
Now I am heading home.
